A] hover:text-[#804526] transition-colors truncate" href="#28-templates">28. Page Templates</a><div class="mt-8 first:mt-2 mb-3 text-[0.7rem] font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#804526] border-b-[0.5px] border-[#55555a26] pb-2">QA</div><a class="block py-1.5 text-[0.8rem] text-[#55555A] hover:text-[#804526] transition-colors truncate" href="#29-qa">29. QA &amp; Governance</a></nav>
