</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="text-[0.75rem] font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#55555A] mb-4">It Must NEVER Feel</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-y-2 text-[0.9rem] text-[#55555A] opacity-80">
