<th class="text-left py-4 px-4 border-b-[0.5px] border-[#55555a26] text-[0.85rem] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#55555A]">Weight &amp; Size (Fluid)</th>
<th class="text-left py-4 px-4 border-b-[0.5px] border-[#55555a26] text-[0.85rem] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#55555A]">Usage</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
