<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-normal text-[#1C1C1E] mb-2">10. Iconography</h2>
<p class="font-sans text-[1rem] text-[#55555A] max-w-3xl mb-12 leading-relaxed">Icons must be purely functional. We exclusively use un-filled line icons with a strict <code>2px</code> stroke in Obsidian Black or Neutral Grey. <strong>Usage Rule:</strong> Use only when they add analytical clarity.</p>
