<p class="font-sans text-[1rem] text-[#55555A] max-w-3xl mb-12 leading-relaxed">HNI clients do not fill out "squeeze pages." Our forms must feel like secure, private banking applications. No bubbly inputs. We use strict 0.5px borders, 4px radiuses, and crisp typography.</p>
