<section class="scroll-mt-16 mb-24 pb-16 border-b-[0.5px] border-[#55555a26]">
<h3 class="font-serif text-[1.25rem] font-bold text-[#1C1C1E] mt-12 mb-4">Clinical Badges &amp; Tags (The Anti-Pill Rule)</h3>
<p class="font-sans text-[1rem] text-[#55555A] max-w-3xl mb-12 leading-relaxed">Standard web design uses rounded "pill" tags (<code>border-radius: 4px</code>). We strictly reject this. All tags (RERA, Status, Scores) must use our rigid <code>4px</code> geometry to maintain an architectural, blueprint-like aesthetic.</p>
