</div>
</section><section class="scroll-mt-16 mb-24 pb-16 border-b-[0.5px] border-[#55555a26]">
<h3 class="font-serif text-[1.25rem] font-bold text-[#1C1C1E] mt-12 mb-4">Cinematic Modals &amp; Overlays</h3>
<p class="font-sans text-[1rem] text-[#55555A] max-w-3xl mb-12 leading-relaxed">Pop-ups should not feel like marketing interruptions. Modal backdrops must use a heavy cinematic blur (<code>backdrop-filter: blur(8px)</code>) with a deep, desaturated overlay (<code>rgba(10,10,10,0.85)</code>) to completely focus the user's attention.</p>
<div>
<!-- Modal Backdrop Overlay -->
<div>
<!-- Modal Card -->
<div>
